# Telegram delivery for the brief and consultation forms (server-side only — never exposed to the browser).
# 1. Create a bot with @BotFather → token.
# 2. Add the bot to the studio's chat/group, send any message, then read the chat id from
#    https://api.telegram.org/bot<TOKEN>/getUpdates  (a group id looks like -1001234567890).
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=
TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID=

# Optional: point the forms at a different endpoint (default /api/lead).
# VITE_LEAD_ENDPOINT=
